   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2019-08-02.cm33** (recommended): audience recording; 23 songs; 166 min [1]\n- **mmj2019-08-02**: source not stated; 24 songs; 163 min; rated 5/5 by 5 [2]. Said about its sound: The recording features a clear mix with minimal crowd noise; Vocals, instruments, and crowd noise are balanced correctly in the capture [3][4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The reviewer attended both nights of the concert at the venue [6]\n- This performance was the first of a two-night stand at Red Rocks [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2019-08-02.cm33**: taped by opsopcopolis; transferred by opsopcopolis; source: AUD [1]\n- **mmj2019-08-02**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: DPA 4023 > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [2]. Also: Alex Leary recorded and posted the audio file; Transferred from MP6 to iMac, tracked in Sound Studio, FLAC via xACT [2][4]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Guy Burwell: [My Morning Jacket Live Archive - 2019-08-02 Red Rocks Amphitheatre - Morrison, CO](https://archive.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/shows/2019-shows/2019-08-02-red-rocks-amphitheatre-morrison-co) [9]\n- Poster by Mindy Bond: [My Morning Jacket Stream 2019 Red Rocks Concert](https://www.theculturefiles.com/events/my-morning-jacket-live-at-red-rocks-from-august-2-2019/) [10]",
